# Bot1 targets Bot2: Bot2 mills its top two cards (Forest, Plains) and Bot1, the caster, draws a card (Forest).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Thought Scour
Swamp x5
Forest
Swamp x3

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain x7
Forest
Plains
Mountain x6

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Thought Scour.Cast(Bot2)

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Plains; Forest
Bot2.Library.Count = 6
Bot1.Graveyard = Thought Scour
Bot1.Hand = Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Swamp; Forest
Bot1.Library.Count = 3
